# ADR-0314 (F-32, F-43): COMMIT with no open transaction is a protocol
# breach: one FAILURE, then the server closes the connection.
!: BOLT 4.4
!: AUTO HELLO

C: COMMIT
S: FAILURE {"code": "Neo.ClientError.Request.Invalid", "message": "Message of type CommitMessage cannot be handled by a session in the READY state."}
S: <EXIT>
